1
00:00:00,291 --> 00:00:01,668
Why did you come back

2
00:00:02,419 --> 00:00:03,711
from Austria?

3
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:07,424
That's...

4
00:00:07,424 --> 00:00:08,807
A lot of talented students

5
00:00:08,808 --> 00:00:10,342
playing piano

6
00:00:10,343 --> 00:00:11,151
go through the cycle

7
00:00:11,152 --> 00:00:11,995
heading overseas

8
00:00:11,996 --> 00:00:13,583
and coming back.

9
00:00:15,515 --> 00:00:17,017
Seonghun

10
00:00:17,017 --> 00:00:18,337
I'm sure there were
lots of people

11
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:20,175
who said you're a genius

12
00:00:20,176 --> 00:00:21,478
when you were a kid.

13
00:00:21,479 --> 00:00:22,647
But I'm sure you realized

14
00:00:22,647 --> 00:00:24,072
how tough and new it becomes

15
00:00:24,073 --> 00:00:25,902
the more you practice.

16
00:00:26,234 --> 00:00:27,902
Feels like being reborn.

17
00:00:31,114 --> 00:00:32,531
Professor.

18
00:00:32,531 --> 00:00:34,200
I love playing the piano.

19
00:00:36,995 --> 00:00:38,079
So do I.

20
00:00:39,414 --> 00:00:40,414
But...

21
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:45,420
Dong-uk

22
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,213
is really gifted.

23
00:00:47,213 --> 00:00:48,213
Yes

24
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,216
I know.

25
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:51,912
And you're exceptional, too.

26
00:00:52,886 --> 00:00:54,679
I hope you two can

27
00:00:54,679 --> 00:00:55,972
do well on this recital.

28
00:00:59,017 --> 00:01:00,017
I'll do my best.

29
00:01:00,769 --> 00:01:01,769
Huh?

30
00:01:02,103 --> 00:01:03,063
Sir!

31
00:01:03,063 --> 00:01:04,480
Hello, Professor.

32
00:01:04,980 --> 00:01:06,107
Great to see you, freshman.
